"""Content of the community police career (game/careers/police.py): Công an phường Mây.

Everything here is fictional: the ward, its people, the forms ("Phiếu khai báo tạm trú" of the game), the call
priority card and the patrol rule ("nhắc trước, biên bản sau") are game rules written to teach the habits of a
community officer: serve everyone the same, never take an envelope, listen to both sides, verify before handing over
a child or someone's property, put people in danger first, write down only what really happened. No real law,
article or agency is cited; no tactic, weapon or use of force appears anywhere.

Case ids are part of saved tasks (`_v`): never rename or remove one, only add.
"""
